{
"file": 471,
"paths": [
"d008/d024/f012",
"d008/d024/f036"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "e4fb896c",
"en_raw": "Sorry to bother you..."
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "6de28bb7",
"en_raw": "Doesn't your hand hurt?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "b1bfa2e7",
"en_raw": "At first"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "482fa2e1",
"en_raw": "How long will you keep going?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "976eacd8",
"en_raw": "About twelve hours a day"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "b2a390da",
"en_raw": "Do you get breaks?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "c969189b",
"en_raw": "Every four hours"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "d454ef59",
"en_raw": "Um, is it some kind of practice?"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "11849cdd",
"en_raw": "I don't think so"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a00cb033",
"en_raw": "Um, this is very rude, but"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "17940ff2",
"en_raw": "there aren't many people"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "75dec1e3",
"en_raw": "watching, are there?"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "d3306af9",
"en_raw": "Oh, um"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "ffcd979f",
"en_raw": "I think it's good, though"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "f8817825",
"en_raw": "You don't need to worry so much"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "d388737d",
"en_raw": "I'm doing it because I like it"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "7c26cef4",
"en_raw": "Why do you keep"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "093fa818",
"en_raw": "doing it?"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "65a21aa6",
"en_raw": "If I knew that"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "ba9dcb6e",
"en_raw": "I might quit"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "24561c88",
"en_raw": "There are lots of other"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "d16a2d50",
"en_raw": "well, how to put it"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "7143b05e",
"en_raw": "worthwhile things..."
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "7dd1b703",
"en_raw": "Right, that's the problem"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "2b8a7a90",
"en_raw": "What is worth"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fb9b3f44",
"en_raw": "I don't know"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "5f21411c",
"en_raw": "You won't quit, then"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "524fc0f0",
"en_raw": "Yes"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "7c22bf68",
"en_raw": "I don't mean to disturb you"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "de313299",
"en_raw": "but..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "9e6b92f9",
"en_raw": "I get it"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "28f1686f",
"en_raw": "My actions lately put"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0fcb3eff",
"en_raw": "pressure on those around me"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "4ba1748e",
"en_raw": "Starting with you"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "b54f738d",
"en_raw": "For a sensitive person"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "098bffc9",
"en_raw": "it doesn't seem ordinary"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "f25d2689",
"en_raw": "Indeed"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "0ca3883f",
"en_raw": "No, that's not it, but..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "d0efdc6d",
"en_raw": "The other day too"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "257c8bf2",
"en_raw": "the other person"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8b63626a",
"en_raw": "said something similar"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "01184f6c",
"en_raw": "to me"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "dd758935",
"en_raw": "It was by chance"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "d3cf0fde",
"en_raw": "so"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "1e08ebd5",
"en_raw": "I didn't quit"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "2ca05ddd",
"en_raw": "Then will you quit?"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "2c1c1462",
"en_raw": "I quit, but I don't"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "2120f4fa",
"en_raw": "Tomorrow I'll be gone from here"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "4fd6db77",
"en_raw": "but I won't quit, I'll keep searching"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "6a20cae9",
"en_raw": "Probably until the world collapses"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "689296de",
"en_raw": "...Well, you shouldn't talk"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "97c30566",
"en_raw": "to adults like me too much"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "57bd0033",
"en_raw": "May I ask one last thing?"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "f6aba84f",
"en_raw": "Ask anything"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "15ca0ad4",
"en_raw": "What are you searching for?"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "0e157db2",
"en_raw": "...A happy ending"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "5c60f766",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "8f156313",
"en_raw": "Um, excuse me..."
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "c68ac33a",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "0e75cfe9",
"en_raw": "What music are you listening to?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "e138a153",
"en_raw": "Cool techno"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "ded83f8b",
"en_raw": "I listen every day with my cat"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "d3bf3431",
"en_raw": "since the landlord is noisy"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "ad3c0a1f",
"en_raw": "we put in earphones"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "6e4e4742",
"en_raw": "one in each of our ears"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "9a442028",
"en_raw": "Cats listen to music?"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "bd45f85c",
"en_raw": "My kitty is special-made"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "47594f22",
"en_raw": "Not just music"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "39759385",
"en_raw": "she drinks beer too"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "11470efa",
"en_raw": "She hated it at first"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "b10ea6f4",
"en_raw": "but she got used to it, it's fun"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "d96be431",
"en_raw": "So, you"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "daf98e88",
"en_raw": "going to buy something?"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "55248c3e",
"en_raw": "...Oh, um"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "f6aae28d",
"en_raw": "let me take a look"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "6a4139fb",
"en_raw": "Sure~"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "d397a392",
"en_raw": "...Sorry"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "20241747",
"en_raw": "I'm kind of busy now"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "1769ac8c",
"en_raw": "Is that game fun?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "9b53e2a0",
"en_raw": "The best"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "677efaca",
"en_raw": "...An RPG?"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "ce550bb3",
"en_raw": "What kind is it?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "a625208e",
"en_raw": "A super stoic"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "48895d17",
"en_raw": "level-grinding game"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ea0dd156",
"en_raw": "My Ninja AC"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "536033c5",
"en_raw": "went into the negative double digits"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "3b1ffac5",
"en_raw": "...Do you know this slang?"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "c03a63da",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "1769ac8c",
"en_raw": "Is that game fun?"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "17ce4350",
"en_raw": "All right, today"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "92d35d24",
"en_raw": "to you, who seem low on human voltage"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "169bfe2d",
"en_raw": "I'll teach you something amazing"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "bd08b66f",
"en_raw": "The truth of this world that I grasped"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "a04d50e8",
"en_raw": "...What is it?"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "71cf50b9",
"en_raw": "The truth of fiction"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "c2da7127",
"en_raw": "This world you think is real"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "debb7a33",
"en_raw": "it's actually been"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "7d815d37",
"en_raw": "programmed by someone"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "3812f8be",
"en_raw": "A very well-made RPG... get it?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "d07077c3",
"en_raw": "Somehow..."
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "7e446af6",
"en_raw": "And, at first glance,"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "345b72f6",
"en_raw": "a mere citizen of Hirumi City, me"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "344a9fd5",
"en_raw": "Why did I"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "bd8913dc",
"en_raw": "notice that?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "c8c86cde",
"en_raw": "Well, you see"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "b25dcd6e",
"en_raw": "the protagonist of this RPG"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "bc2163af",
"en_raw": "is, believe it or not, me"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "59be2b4a",
"en_raw": "So, therefore, besides me"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "4f3b5f9a",
"en_raw": "everyone else is running on"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "e6d80ffe",
"en_raw": "programs somebody made"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "d1736843",
"en_raw": "...You too, of course"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "ffd1f896",
"en_raw": "So, surprised?"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "409543de",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "7f2023b6",
"en_raw": "By the way, in what comes next"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "72b297fa",
"en_raw": "I go to Egypt"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "3d04d845",
"en_raw": "and super ancient magic"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "3fe46c4d",
"en_raw": "from the seal"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "8f535278",
"en_raw": "after releasing it,"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "298251e4",
"en_raw": "I board a space shuttle"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "644d8cbd",
"en_raw": "and the moment I leave into space,"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "c9180f1a",
"en_raw": "the Earth"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "a037c04b",
"en_raw": "explodes..."
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "3768e6fa",
"en_raw": "And after a long time"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "12aca2af",
"en_raw": "wandering space"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "207f84b4",
"en_raw": "I find a new planet"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "84b8c2fe",
"en_raw": "and on that planet"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "966541e6",
"en_raw": "I'm called Eve"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "01cd7be9",
"en_raw": "...Amazing, right?"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "409543de",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "79bc33de",
"en_raw": "So America, the continent,"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "df7daba3",
"en_raw": "is"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "25ea5812",
"en_raw": "exists in the setting"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "0b3717ca",
"en_raw": "but really it's nowhere"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "10f4fabe",
"en_raw": "I guess the capacity ran out"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "33f30a94",
"en_raw": "The person who thought up this RPG's"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "78e9abd4",
"en_raw": "scenario is a genius"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "0add0030",
"en_raw": "Ahh"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "c116ba44",
"en_raw": "I want to go to Egypt soon~"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "2730cd7b",
"en_raw": "Egypt, Egypt"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "4b426675",
"en_raw": "Um..."
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "08b74980",
"en_raw": "You're a middle schooler?"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "c3fa3b00",
"en_raw": "A portrait is 500 yen"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "e5891209",
"en_raw": "Oh, no thanks"
}
]
}